     "periodStartPrecision": "day",
     "periodEndPrecision": "month",
     "heading": {
      "zh-Hant": "出身與波蘭軍團",
      "en": "Origins and the Polish Legions"
     },
     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "塔德烏什·路德維克·皮斯科爾於1889年2月1日生於奧斯特羅韋茨附近的博爾。1907年他在華沙完成文科中學學業。1914年8月，第一次世界大戰爆發後，他開始在波蘭軍團服役，起初在第一旅的參謀部工作。",
      "en": "Tadeusz Ludwik Piskor was born on 1 February 1889 at Bór near Ostrowiec. In 1907 he finished a philological gymnasium in Warsaw. After the outbreak of the First World War he began service in the Polish Legions in August 1914, at first working on the staff of the 1st Brigade."
     },
