     "heading": {
      "zh-Hant": "一戰末期與入波蘭軍隊",
      "en": "Late First World War and entry into the Polish Army"
     },
     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "1917年3月，皮斯科爾完成總參謀部課程。同年誓言危機之後，他被德軍拘禁。1918年11月初，他開始在波蘭軍隊服役。",
      "en": "In March 1917 Piskor completed the General Staff course. After the oath crisis of that year the Germans interned him. He began service in the Polish Army at the beginning of November 1918."
     },
