     "heading": {
      "zh-Hant": "盧布林集團軍司令與投降",
      "en": "Commander of the Lublin Army and capitulation"
     },
     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "德國入侵波蘭後，皮斯科爾於1939年9月4日奉命組建盧布林集團軍（Armia „Lublin”）；IPN的文章也記載，雷茲-希米格維在同一日下令成立該集團軍。他的任務起初是防守維斯瓦河中游，其後是前往羅馬尼亞橋頭堡。托馬舒夫盧貝爾斯基戰役之後，他於9月20日下令投降。",
      "en": "After the German invasion, Piskor was ordered on 4 September 1939 to organize the Lublin Army (Armia „Lublin”); an IPN article likewise records that Rydz-Śmigły ordered the army's creation on 4 September. His task was first to defend the central Vistula and then to reach the Romanian bridgehead. After the Battle of Tomaszów Lubelski he issued the order to capitulate on 20 September."
     },
