    {
     "ord": 5,
     "period": {
      "start": "1939-09-20",
      "end": "1951-03-22"
     },
     "periodStartPrecision": "day",
     "periodEndPrecision": "day",
     "heading": {
      "zh-Hant": "戰俘、流亡與逝世",
      "en": "Captivity, exile and death"
     },
     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "投降後，皮斯科爾直到戰爭結束都在德國戰俘營中。1945年4月他前往英國，在倫敦定居。他於1951年3月22日在倫敦去世；1990年，他的骨灰罈安放於托馬舒夫盧貝爾斯基的戰爭公墓。",
      "en": "After the capitulation Piskor remained in German captivity until the end of the war. In April 1945 he left for Great Britain and settled in London. He died in London on 22 March 1951; in 1990 an urn with his ashes was placed in the war cemetery at Tomaszów Lubelski."
     },
